    "No direct CSF or brain PK measurement for the query itself is present in the provided evidence.",
    "The P-gp substrate status of the query is not directly established in the evidence set.",
    "The closest direct analog, mescaline, is labeled 'poor' by the source, so the threshold for 'meaningful' access is inferred from the measured ratio."
  ],
